# "For as long as you control Ty Lee" (CR 611.2b), the rulings: if another player gains control of her the effect ends, and regaining control
# won't make it resume. Memnite, tapped by her trigger on turn 2, is still tapped in Bot2's untap step on turn 4 (Bot1 controls her). Bot2's
# Act of Treason takes her that turn and gives her back at its end; Memnite stays tapped through turn 4 and untaps in Bot2's turn 6 untap
# step, though Bot1 controls Ty Lee again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Ty Lee, Chi Blocker
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Memnite
Act of Treason
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
